==Trivia==
*Yatta is the first [[Toon]] featured in a thumbnail who is not running away from a [[Twisted]]. Instead, she is shown working on a [[Machine]], next to {{CI|Twisted Razzle & Dazzle|name=true}}.
*Yatta was meant to be released in a later update but was released early as an apology for not finishing the optimized {{Type|Main}} [[Toons]]' models for the [[Changelog|v0.7.1]] update, except for [[Pebble]] and his {{CI|Twisted Pebble}} [[Twisted Pebble|Twisted counterpart]]'s optimized model.<ref>https://discord.com/channels/969934252844138496/970049062608961560/1344802320482959371</ref> It is likely her and {{CI|Blot|name=true}} were meant to release together as they are both Circus Troupe members and both their [[Introduction Cards]] were released alongside Blot.
*Yatta is the first [[Toon]] to not have an [[Introduction Card]] at release due to her early launch. However it was later added in a reworked map.
**She and {{CI|Brusha|name=true}} share this trait as well as:
***Being female.
***Having to travel less than 50,000 meters for their [[Masteries]].
***Sharing a similar color scheme for their Halloween [[Skins]].
*Yatta is part of a three-[[Toon]] circus act simply known as the '''Circus Troupe''', with her role being that of an acrobat. The other two members are [[Blot]] (a mime) and {{CI|Looey|name=true}} (a clown).
*It is most likely that Yatta is {{wp|Hispanic}}, which would make her the first [[Toon]] to have a specified real-world ethnicity. This is because when making Yatta [[Qwel]] had researched Hispanic history.<ref>https://discordapp.com/channels/969934252844138496/1251545388259741768/1350851131475103765</ref>
**Yatta is based on the traditional 7-point piñata, which culturally symbolizes breaking free from sin and temptation<ref>https://discord.com/channels/969934252844138496/1251545388259741768/1350850126771392612</ref> and is a staple of Hispanic culture.
**Yatta was planned to say a line in Spanish upon being added to the game, but because of Roblox's automatic translations, the line could have been miscommunicated. Qwel thought it would be safer to wait until she can get a more official translations in the future before adding any other languages to characters.<ref>https://discord.com/channels/969934252844138496/1251545388259741768/1350852340160135178</ref>
*Yatta crawls around through [[Gardenview]]'s ventilation system in order to get around, as proven in her interactions with {{CI|Shelly|name=true}}, {{CI|Toodles|name=true}}, and {{CI|Vee|name=true}}. Some [[Toons]] can hear her in the walls.
